# Festerleech: "{1}{B}: This creature gets +2/+2 until end of turn. Activate only once each turn" (CR 602.5b) and "Whenever this creature deals combat damage to a player,
# you mill two cards" (CR 510.2, 701.17a). Bot1 has Mox Jet and two Black Lotuses. On turn 3 the Leech is pumped to 3/3 for a Lotus's mana; a second pump the same turn is
# refused even with a second Lotus's mana available. It attacks unblocked: Bot2 takes 3 and Bot1 mills two Swamps. On turn 5 the once-each-turn limit has reset and a
# pump paid with the Mox and an Island is accepted, and the 3/3 is back to 1/1 on turn 4 (the pump ended with the turn).

